<emph etype = "bold">
C1170: Lane Departure Prevention Switch Circuit
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
P/S control module received ON signal of lane departure prevention switch from dual sensor brake support control module for specified time continuously.
</ptxt>
</entry>
